<title>INDIA: India forex market inactive as Bombay banks closed.</title>
<headline>India forex market inactive as Bombay banks closed.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Few trades were reported on Tuesday in India's foreign exchange market as banks and companies were closed for a local holiday in Bombay, the main financial centre.</p>
<p>The rupee closed steady at 35.72/73 in dull trade on Monday. Banks in Bombay reopen on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
